# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.
#
# Monorepo टीप: इथले बहुतेक नियम **anchored नाहीत** (सुरुवातीला `/` नाही) — म्हणून
# ते कुठल्याही खोलीवर लागू होतात. Anchored ठेवले तर `apps/admin/.next/` किंवा
# `packages/core/node_modules/` सारखी folders सुटतात आणि चुकून commit होतात.

# dependencies
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
coverage/

# next.js
.next/
out/

# expo / react native
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.orig.*

# nestjs
/backend/dist/

# production
build/

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# local database
*.db
*.db-journal

# user-uploaded content
public/uploads/

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
expo-env.d.ts

# agent skills — vendored third-party docs, restorable from skills-lock.json
# (the lockfile is committed; these are the node_modules equivalent).
# .claude/skills holds machine-local symlinks into .agents.
/.agents/
/.claude/skills/

# graphify knowledge-graph output (generated)
graphify-out/
.env.local
